The reason why you should always consider them is quite simple – as a software architect,
you cannot spend time reinventing the wheel. However, there is another great reason for
using them: you will find many patterns implemented in .NET Core.
In the next few subsections, we will cover some of the most well-known patterns. However,
the idea of this chapter is to let you know that they exist and need to be studied so that you
can accelerate and simplify your project. Moreover, each pattern with be presented with a
